<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Pipe '96 net loss vs '95 profit.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Pipe '96 net loss vs '95 profit.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)	    (loss)    633     vs  (gain)  393</p>
<p>    Net		    (loss)	7.78  vs  (gain)    3.93</p>
<p>    Profit/loss before tax  (loss) 7.78  vs  (gain)    4.24</p>
<p>    Turnover			   453.99  vs	    414.41</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>			 in cash	  none   vs     5.0</p>
<p>    Extraordiaries (million)(loss) 25    vs  (gain) 11,276.0</p>
<p>Note - Hyundai Pipe Co, an affiliate of the Hyundai Group, said its share capital rose to 15 million in 1996 from 10 million a year earlier from rights issues.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
